<title>USA: Westbury, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Westbury, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $1.655 million of Westbury, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
